          "type": "TSharedPtr<FMediaTextureSampleQueue>"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Set the media player that provides the video samples and optionally the sample queue\nthat receives them. If no sample queue is provided, the media texture creates a new one internally.\n@param NewMediaPlayer The player to set.\n@param InSampleQueue Provide an optional sample queue to use instead of creating a new one.\n@see GetMediaPlayer"
    },
    {
